triage: fix_game: The rules are clear and within the platform's abilities, but the game file draws from the wrong end of the deck and does not put the right bid amounts to the bidders. In the trace, given deck ['green-2','blue-1'], the game picked 'blue-1' (the last card) first. The bid tests also report that seat 2 (4 Gold) was never offered 4 or 0 and seat 3 (2 Gold) was never offered 2. Because those bids never happen, the sole-winner and tie scenarios fail as a knock-on effect.
