triage: fix_game: The tests follow the rules, but the game does not offer the moves the rules require. Bidding seats were never given the options 0 to their gold, so every bid fell to 0 and no lot was ever sold. The draw also did not offer the active seat the top 2 cards of the given deck.
step C: building the game file
step D: evaluating
triage: fix_game: In three bidding scenarios the scripted bids never reached the game. Seat 2 was never offered 4 or 0, seat 3 was never offered 2, and Blaise and Cleo were never offered 2. As a result no sale ever happened (bought [] and sale_price 0 where the rules require blue-2 and a price of 3). The bid step is not presenting the whole-number range 0..current gold to each non-active seat, which is a game-file error and not a rules or platform problem.
