triage: fix_game: The rules are sound and expressible: hidden hands and private values are supported. The coder keeps alternating between two fixable mistakes. One is writing {offer} and {gold} into prompts, where only {value} and {seat} can be filled in. The other is showing the state while the public lot and gift fields are still blank.
step C: building the game file
